D[erm]apen 4 has a[ 16] needle cartridge instead of just 12 needles, reaching an inflammatory response at a much quicker rate.
The D[erm]apen 4 generates[ 47].9% more micro-channels than D[erm]apen 3 and 104% more micro-channels than any counterfeit device.
The D[erm]apen 4 generates 1,920 puncture channels per second, which means we can almost double the amount of serums and actives that we needle into the skin per treatment, than before.
The[ additional 620] micro-channels makes the treatment much quicker and more comfortable than before.
D[erm]apen 4 is the only microneedling device with a dedicated scar setting and protocols for[ revision] of deep, at[rophic scars]; including[ surgical], burn contracture, striae and post-acne[ scars]. Needle penetration can now be increased up to 3.0mm.
AOVN technology, automatically calibrates the motor speed, pressure and penetration for targeted precision.
The D[erm]apen 4 is safer than other microneedling devices, no dragging or pulling of the skin.
Only D[erm]apen 4 features a unique, medical-grade silicone seal and fluid guard. The external cartridge is[ fortified] with a specialised fluid guard that prevents cross contamination to the outer cartridge shell. Safety First!
Specialised retention valves relieve the build-up of[ procedural] pressure within the D[erm]apen 4 needle cartridge. The effect prevents fluid build-up within the needle cavity. The vacuum-like sensation removes the risk of cross contamination[ whilst] ensuring pressure-free contact to the skin during a procedure.
